:: Combat remake [player-turn Town NoSave] {"position":"0,2075","size":"100,100"}
You have encountered:
<<for _i = 0; _i lte 99; _i++>>\
  	<<if $mobs[_i]>>\
 	Level <<= $mobs[_i].lvl.toFixed(0)>> <<= $mobs[_i].name>>: <<= $mobs[_i].CurHP.toFixed(2)>>/<<= $mobs[_i].MaxHP.toFixed(2)>> <<if $mobs[_i].PowerUpCount >= 0.1>> | <span class="bleedTrigger"><<= $mobs[_i].PowerUpCount.toFixed(0)>> (<<= $mobs[_i].PowerUpPotency.toFixed(2)>>)<img class="status" src = "Textures/Statuses/STR raise.png" /></span><</if>> <<if $mobs[_i].bleedCountCur >= 0.1>> | <span class="bleedTrigger"><<= $mobs[_i].bleedCountCur.toFixed(2)>>/<<= $mobs[_i].bleedCountMax.toFixed(0)>> (<<= $mobs[_i].bleedPotency.toFixed(2)>>)<img class="status" src = "Textures/Statuses/Bleed.png" /></span><</if>> <<if $mobs[_i].burnCountCur >= 0.1>> | <span class="burnTrigger"><<= $mobs[_i].burnCountCur.toFixed(0)>> (<<= $mobs[_i].burnPotency.toFixed(2)>>)<img class="status" src = "Textures/Statuses/Burn.png" /></span><</if>>
 	<</if>>\
<</for>>\
